00]],"about":{"what":"Unity Software Inc. (U). This chart runs from Jul 30, 2021 to Dec 6, 2021.","setup":"The stock rose about 56% in the three months before the base. It then formed a base for about 3 weeks, peaking at $144.59 and pulling back 18% at its deepest. Daily price ranges tightened on the right side of the base.","outcome":"On Oct 18, 2021 it closed at $146.00, its first close above the base high of $144.59. Volume that day was 3.1M shares, 1.45x the prior 10-day average of 2.2M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $201.12, and the chart ends at $147.57.","lesson":"This is an example of a textbook breakout: a base, then a close above it on heavy volume, and it held. This is the pattern the rules are built around."}}